The ollama.com homepage contains information about Ollama, a platform that allows users to use open models with their coding agents while keeping their data private. The website highlights the benefits of using Ollama, including:

* Reliably fast performance with dedicated capacity
* Frontier capability with access to the latest open models at a fraction of the cost
* Private and secure data storage with cloud models hosted in US, Europe, and Singapore
* Predictable pricing with no hidden limits or confusing fees

Ollama also mentions that users can launch popular tools like Claude Code, Codex, and more with one command, and that their data is never trained on by any provider. The website provides a range of pricing options, including a free plan for local models.

Overall, the ollama.com homepage presents Ollama as a reliable and secure platform for developers to use open models while keeping their data private and controlling costs.

